    "title": "Learn a communication strategy",
    "subtitle": "A guest joins the group · 1",
    "context": "Use the selected vocabulary and constructions to welcome someone, establish relationships and resolve a misunderstanding about who is involved.",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U5-01-skill-K-HSK5-listen-teach",
        "kind": "teach",
        "title": "HSK 5: listen",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "Separate an event from a speaker’s opinion about it. Compare accounts by the facts they state and by the reasons or qualifications they add; disagreement in opinion need not be disagreement about the event.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "亲人",
                "pinyin": "qīnrén",
                "meaning": "one's close relatives",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "b52bd689f1cbf100cba525a8f67e76bd7332f5a807ac7563a68ad6e6f6d868fb"
              },
              {
                "text": "熟人",
                "pinyin": "shúrén",
                "meaning": "acquaintance; friend",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "2b9284569425a3ae761f557fb5907615267d478a435d1a7184c7f127787cdeac"
              },
              {
                "text": "认为",
                "pinyin": "rènwéi",
                "meaning": "to believe; to think",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "cb6fec095e11769414fd90d687de1cd4adc5a3c7f78407502416584a9885e0a5"
              },
              {
                "text": "以为",
                "pinyin": "yǐwéi",
                "meaning": "think or assume, often with a mistaken belief",
                "singleWord": true,
                "audio": "f0e85a30ea9f6cadd59af8dfb0097b9907e1f4eb7a2eec08d9f57050e02e4ab5"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A and B discuss a third person. A speaks first; B speaks second.\nFamiliar meanings available: one's close relatives; acquaintance; friend; to believe; to think; think or assume, often with a mistaken belief."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "EX-CORE-U5-01-skill-K-HSK5-listen-listen-check-item-1",
        "kind": "check",
        "title": "Understand the scoped spoken exchange",
        "questions": [
          {
            "id": "EX-CORE-U5-01-skill-K-HSK5-listen-listen-meaning-1",
